# Title: Always Install Elevated MSI Spawned Cmd And Powershell
# ID: 1e53dd56-8d83-4eb4-a43e-b790a05510aa
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Teymur Kheirkhabarov (idea), Mangatas Tondang (rule), oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-13
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002
# Description: Detects Windows Installer service (msiexec.exe) spawning "cmd" or "powershell"
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process_name:*\\cmd.exe OR process_name:*\\powershell.exe OR process_name:*\\pwsh.exe)) OR ((OriginalFileName:"Cmd.Exe" OR OriginalFileName:"PowerShell.EXE" OR OriginalFileName:"pwsh.dll"))) AND ((parent_name:*\\Windows\\Installer\\* AND parent_name:*msi*) AND parent_name:*tmp))
